{
	"doc": "Every key a program week override may carry, and the field it replaces on the training item. The set is closed: a key the backend names and a client does not read is dropped from the prescription the athlete plays, rather than merely ignored there. The canonical copy lives in crimpy-backend, next to the itemOverride struct it is asserted against; crimpy-app and crimpy-frontend vendor it byte for byte and hold their own merge to it by test. The sample is a value every client can parse, so each of them can check that a key on its own reaches the item.",
